<title>HONG KONG: Int'l Pipe interim profit jumps 92.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Int'l Pipe interim profit jumps 92.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.5  vs  6.03</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0   vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    25.19 vs  13.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		     86.02 vs  62.93</p>
<p>    Company name		 International Pipe Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-10</p>
